entle Vitamin A at night can fit a skin density routine once your barrier feels calm. Start slowly, and pause if your skin stings. #MenopauseSkin #SkinCare https://t.co/g2ztRGG6RY https://t.co/FbrUrdy6qf","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2114668107893768452"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:28:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114333150960640093"],"id":"2114333150960640093","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Cleanse gently. Hydrate on damp skin. Seal with a cream. See a gentle #skin care routine I share for a beautiful skincare reset in menopause. #MenopauseSkin #SkinCare https://t.co/6Sp3SGwVMK https://t.co/dOtXoC0MMT","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2114333150960640093"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-24T20:12:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114087532292186333"],"id":"2114087532292186333","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Not every active belongs in every season. When menopause skin feels sensitive, pause exfoliating #acids first, then bring them back one at a time. #MenopauseSkin #SkinCare #skin https://t.co/6Sp3SGxtCi https://t.co/D1jKwCyJPC","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2114087532292186333"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-24T16:02:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114024618595860890"],"id":"2114024618595860890","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Barrier first, always. A calm, hydrated barrier is the base every other step builds on, especially when menopause #skin runs dry. #SkinBarrier #Menopause https://t.co/g2ztRGFz2q https://t.co/klmLCpbd3c","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2114024618595860890"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-23T17:22:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113682362630287512"],"id":"2113682362630287512","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Dermatologists advise warm water, not hot, and moisturizing while #skin is still damp. Two simple steps that support a tired menopause skin barrier this winter. #WinterSkin #Menopause #skinbarrier  https://t.co/6Sp3SGwVMK https://t.co/lJ5tiipUWn","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2113682362630287512"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-23T12:06:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113602838681059708"],"id":"2113602838681059708","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Skin density support is a system, not one product. A strong barrier, antioxidants, gentle Vitamin A at night, daily sunscreen, and good inner nutrition all play a part. #MenopauseSkin https://t.co/g2ztRGFz2q https://t.co/BqtvHgD3nf","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2113602838681059708"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-22T19:57:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113358981590876558"],"id":"2113358981590876558","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"October note: know how your skin and breasts normally look and feel, and tell your care team about changes. The American Cancer Society lists skin changes as one thing to watch for. #BreastCancerAwareness https://t.co/g2ztRGG6RY https://t.co/bh8HM4S2tj","url":"https://x.com/DiscoverSelf/status/2113358981590876558"},{"author_id":"24968293","created_at":"2026-10-22T15:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113289272392647168"],"id":"2113289272392647168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A 2025 study found postmenopausal participants reported signifi